{"id":"e9091f671971bda5","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheafification-preserves-monomorphisms.md","title":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Monomorphisms","display":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Monomorphisms","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-monomorphisms","aliases":["14-thm-sheafification-preserves-monomorphisms"],"display":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Monomorphisms","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-monomorphisms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheafification-preserves-monomorphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Monomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cbd8e35070d95035\" href=\"?note=cbd8e35070d95035\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits\">14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,\\eta)\">\\((a,\\eta)\\)</span> 是小站点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 上的层化函子（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:F\\to G\">\\(m:F\\to G\\)</span> 为预层箭头。左、右两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsMono}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsMono}\\)</span> 分别在预层范畴、层范畴解释；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}(m)\\to\\mathrm{IsMono}(a(m)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}(m)\\to\\mathrm{IsMono}(a(m)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Theorem 1 的左正合性，印刷页 128、133–134；DjVu 第 70、72–73 图页。下述单态射保持结论由此推出。单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 当且仅当对角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to F\\times_G F\">\\(F\\to F\\times_G F\\)</span> 为同构；层化保拉回及同构，故保持此条件。也可用局部相等的刻画直接证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"cbd8e35070d95035","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor